            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" frames = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (frames &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(frames);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" frames++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code>'dan <code>2</code>'ye kadar olan sayılar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code> ile <code>3</code> arasındaki sayılar</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code> ile <code>3</code> arasındaki sayılar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>0</code>'dan <code>2</code>'ye kadar olan sayılar.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146820,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>1</code> ile <code>4</code> arasındaki sayıları konsolda görüntüle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"score += 2;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"65\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" score++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>score++;</code>, ardından <code>console.log(score);</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146821,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu koddaki sayaç değişkeninin adı nedir?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Top scores:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rank = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; rank &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; rank++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(rank + \" /><text value=\"&quot;.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>rank</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Top scores:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>rank</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146822,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Konsola <code>1</code>'den <code>4</code>'e kadar olan sayıları yazdıracak for döngüsünü oluştur.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i &gt; 5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i &lt; 4\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>i &lt; 5</code>, ardından <code>console.log(i)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146823,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Enemy spawned!</code> üç kez</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code> ile <code>3</code> arasındaki sayılar</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code> ile <code>3</code> arasındaki sayılar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Enemy spawned!</code> üç kez.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146824,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parantezlerin içinde <code>++</code> operatörünü kullanarak sayaç değişkenini artır.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"68\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level map:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" row = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" row += \" /><text value=\"&quot;#&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(row);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>i++</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146825,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>for döngüsünün sayaç değişkeni hangisidir?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Coins:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" line = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" line += i;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(line);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>label</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>line</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>i</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146826,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" timer = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; timer &gt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; timer--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(timer);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code>'dan <code>5</code>'e kadar artarak sayan sayılar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code>'ten <code>1</code>'e doğru geri sayan sayılar</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"true\"><code>5</code>'ten <code>0</code>'a doğru geriye sayan sayılar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>5</code>'ten <code>0</code>'a doğru geriye sayan sayılar.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146827,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Döngünün içindeki kod çalışıyor mu?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hp = \" /><text value=\"-10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; hp &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; hp++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">Döngünün içindeki kodun çalışıp çalışmadığını söyleyemeyiz</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">Hayır, çünkü döngü başladığında sayaç değişkeninin değeri <code>0</code>'dan küçüktür</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kod çalışır</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hayır, çünkü döngü başladığında sayaç değişkeninin değeri <code>0</code>'dan küçüktür.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 146828,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Döngünün sayaç değişkeni <code>5</code>'e ulaşana kadar çalışacağı, ancak konsola <code>5</code> yazdırmayacağı koşulu kodla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>; i &gt;</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 146829,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Döngü her tekrarlandığında sayaç değişkeni azalacak şekilde yineleyiciyi kodla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ammo++\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ammo += 1\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ammo = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; ammo &gt; \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; ammo--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(ammo);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ammo--</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
