            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 146830,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Koşulu, sayaç değişkeni <code>5</code>'ten <code>1</code>'e kadar geri sayacak şekilde kodla. Koşula <code>1</code> sayısını dahil et.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"index\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt;= \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>i</code>, ardından <code>&gt;=</code> ve son olarak <code>1</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
